                    CIA.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d132-f2" n="2" xml:id="d132-f2-content">
                <p>Here we have a three-way split. The Air Force claims that these figures will
                    represent only bombers. The Army and Joint Staff think the figures are too high.
                    The Navy thinks that the low-limit figures should be correct (400 aircraft in
                    60–62). [Footnote is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
